  "term": "Halcion",
  "definition": "Halcion is triazolam, a triazolobenzodiazepine with sedative-hypnotic effects. It acts at the GABA-A receptor complex on nerve cell membranes, strengthening GABA’s inhibitory action and reducing neuronal excitability.",
